SmartSessionLens::getNonce
├── when nonce has not been revoked
│   ├── it returns zero initially
│   └── it returns zero for different lock tags
├── when nonce has been revoked
│   ├── it returns 1 after single revoke
│   └── it returns correct value after multiple revokes
└── given isolation
    ├── it is isolated per lock tag
    └── it is isolated per account